  "description": "<p>Reverse bits of a given 32 bits signed integer.</p> <p> </p> <p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p> <div class=\"example-block\"> <p><strong>Input:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">n = 43261596</span></p> <p><strong>Output:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">964176192</span></p> <p><strong>Explanation:</strong></p> <table><tbody><tr><th>Integer</th><th>Binary</th></tr><tr><td>43261596</td><td>00000010100101000001111010011100</td></tr><tr><td>964176192</td><td>00111001011110000010100101000000</td></tr></tbody></table> </div> <p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p> <div class=\"example-block\"> <p><strong>Input:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">n = 2147483644</span></p> <p><strong>Output:</strong> <span class=\"example-io\">1073741822</span></p> <p><strong>Explanation:</strong></p> <table><tbody><tr><th>Integer</th><th>Binary</th></tr><tr><td>2147483644</td><td>01111111111111111111111111111100</td></tr><tr><td>1073741822</td><td>00111111111111111111111111111110</td></tr></tbody></table> </div> <p> </p> <p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p> <ul> <li><code>0 &lt;= n &lt;= 2<sup>31</sup> - 2</code></li> <li><code>n</code> is even.</li> </ul> <p> </p> <p><strong>Follow up:</strong> If this function is called many times, how would you optimize it?</p>",
